      "text": "Today you’ll access a new section of the Limay River, where the water widens into deep pools and channels.\n Your guides will introduce techniques suited to the day’s conditions, whether dry fly, nymphing, or streamer fishing.\n Wildlife sightings such as condors, guanacos, and Andean ducks are common along this route.\n Dinner and overnight at the chalet.",
